# Mercedes-Benz S-Class W221 (S350) four-door saloon, 2005-2013.
#
# The W221 S-Class: 5,079 mm long, 1,871 mm wide, 1,473 mm high, 3,035 mm
# wheelbase (long 5,159/3,165); 3.0-6.2 petrol and 3.0 diesel, the S350 the
# volume British model. Facelift in 2009.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercedes-Benz_S-Class_(W221)
#
# Colours: Obsidian Black, Iridium Silver, Andesite Grey and Diamond White are
# period Mercedes-Benz finishes.
#
# Weight: 30 in total (black 12, silver 9, grey 5, white 4).
#
# Speed 250 km/h; comfort 170/435 (line). Class 4.
# Dates: 2005-2013 with a road tail to about 2026.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/mercedes-w221.blend. References:
# citycars/references/mercedes-w221/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

